674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HZGBUx1DD7gQ7kNvwEn-dLZ&_nc_oc=AdqM46tZ9gSGLotoO9KNrKI5Bw6eNSMLnXrNQPKeVavMzg_VhHsKI-RHlRL3jR1MRrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIS-0vsHt-C9vlBARwoj6c3lYXD5dydyMnkAHHLu4qnVA&oe=6AA6B3D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XsQWUVbe7UkQ7kNvwGZerDk&_nc_oc=AdpvFlGwKR8q2LIbltDCt-t058dKo_G6Gj0hhgdiDOQNkZxYXaY3H9ycqvnt0WfyPvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIvJ_wBGokxlga-RqAF5P-nSB2FLU1BfcSQ4qSzFL1CDw&oe=6AA6BC96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XR8IsipNl6gQ7kNvwFsgiPc&_nc_oc=Adp_0Anrqi_V8XedKPxHkUsmvsLqALawp8MsnKBaGXoglyTxIC_LrnRBN7wzWg_6cbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJAV8nZam8NctbSwuhpjlEJzC4AmP5AXYsEpyYkBg7tRA&oe=6AA6B8B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip